<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Frost Death Knight DPS</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Head for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>For the helm slot, we have a clear winner in our tier <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78687/necrotic-boneplate-helmet">
